    "group": "Anrakyr the Traveller",
    "summary": "As your opponent's Shooting phase begins, pick 1 enemy **VEHICLE** unit **visible** to this model and 12\" or less from it. That unit takes a Leadership test:\n\n- Passed: until the phase ends, its models' attacks get -1 to the **Hit roll**.\n- Failed: it cannot shoot this phase.",
